#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: d4800a582fb34e0f9ccf65bdf5088332
msgid "**MIT-mode force control**"
msgstr "**MIT 力控**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: f7d226c9ceb745779e8a1156f425aba5
msgid "**HighTorque** (高擎) **Panthera HT**; **ARX** (方舟无限) arms"
msgstr "**高擎 Panthera HT**；**方舟无限** 机械臂"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: a27726435f47435a9c31efdb042fdbb0
msgid ""
"Controller + hardware interface in MIT / `full_control` (pos + vel + "
