msgstr "切换摇杆平面（`XY` ↔ `Z+Yaw`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:210
#: 55f6ab7e0c7c41beba81a10bc8a72c3b
msgid "**全身** adds grip + stick (ignored in 分体; FSM must already be **OCS2**):"
