#: 7f8da80c32fe4f0e8203c02925950e68
msgid ""
"WBC: up = dual-arm couple on/off, down = chassis unlock/lock, left = "
"reserved, right = reference-joint track"
msgstr "WBC：上 = 双臂耦合开/关，下 = 底盘解锁/锁定，左 = 预留，右 = 参考关节追踪"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:217
#: 6563a7e4fa4b4a27beabc05ceda24a92
msgid ""
"Grip + same-hand trigger switches that trigger’s gripper between percent "
"and open/close. Left **Y** + right **B** is scale-align (turns mirror off"
" and returns to `STORAGE`). Both sticks together toggle chassis teleop ↔ "
"end-effector control."
msgstr ""
"握把 + 同侧扳机切换该扳机所映射夹爪的百分比 / 开合模式。左 **Y** + 右 **B** 为尺度对齐（关闭镜像并退回 "
"`STORAGE`）。左右摇杆同时按下切换底盘遥控 ↔ 末端控制。"

