msgid ""
"Confirm `enable_vr: true` in the description’s "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default off)"
msgstr "确认描述包 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中 `enable_vr: true`（多数机型默认关闭）"

