#: c9b7f6e1ee6a4eb5abddb2f74d7eabce
msgid "Check target poses are within workspace"
msgstr "确认目标位姿在工作空间内"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:272
#: 06f0a3aaf5284f1eac4541170ce87ef7
